This won't be a bit of help with your nethack game, but perhaps it will
be a bit of consolation as they carry your rigid and boiling carcass away
for internment.

See, there is this Group known as the Legion of Concerned Geneticists,
decendents of the Illuminati, who are trying desperately to compensate
for the loss of normal Darwinian genetic selection forces in modern
society, what with the wolves, catamoounts, and grizzly bears all nearly
extinct, and not too fond of cities anyway.  As ways to weed out the
weak and unfit, they have come up with Methamphetamines, Crack, 65 MPH
speed limits, Yield ramps on freeways, wide distribution of handguns,
abortion on demand, plastique luggage, and now their greatest triumph,

                          NetHack!

Yes, you too can balloon an artery or undergo a seizure as your 200K Xp
game goes down the drain to an attack of the munchies or a case of damp
arches!  You can turn into a pile of flesh on a slab as your character
becomes a pile of stone on the floor before the cockatrice gets to the
second 's' in "hissing".  Your character, with an armor class of seven,
can step into a room containing 100 _or_ _more_ aggravated killer bees,
and lose your supervision as you choke on the foam spewing from your
mouth, trying to express the injustice of it all.

Or, you could maintain a Zen like calm and survive to pass your genetic
heritage on to a fitter, better generation.  It's your choice!  Isn't
that nice?

The LGC is extending to you this opportunity to participate in the
improvement of the human species!  Dare you pass up another game of
NetHack, and allow the dregs to inherit the earth?  Play on, brave
adventurer, play on!

